+4.  **Density Normalization:** Compute the normalized density $\hat{\rho}_i$ for compositing:
+    $$ \hat{\rho}_i = \rho_i \frac{\sqrt{2\pi |\mathbf{\hat{\Sigma}}_i|}}{|\mathbf{\hat{\Sigma}}_i|} $$
